  "notes": "Rapid 2.5.7 (Meta's fork of OSM iD). The provided first-viewport thumbnail shows a 'Search features' sidebar with a stylized custom basemap, whereas the full capture shows the feature inspector for node n4212799302 (Insurance Office) over a satellite-like custom basemap with the OSM data layer drawn (cyan waterways, orange primary road, dashed footpaths, red buildings, yellow address points). Fields are stacked grey label-bars with trash/info icon buttons on the right; field group sits in a rounded #ececec well. Section headers are blue (#7092ff) with chevrons. Top toolbar is translucent black with white segmented button group (Point|Line|Area) and branded 'Rapid' Assist button. Right edge has a 40px black icon rail. Map attribution and 'Edits by' contributor list in bottom bar."
